05D3                          ENDIF      
05D3                          IF   CHECKED   
05D3                             ; Clear the lower half of the letter page: every variable starts at
05D3                             ; 0, every word cell holds 0000h, the address an undefined word is
05D3                             ; caught at (see e_hi), and no key is held back.
05D3   21 00 82               LXI   H,LET   
05D6   AF                     XRA   A   
